*>   1998-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 932
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0026.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY INT0026C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 BONUS-RATE         PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 2500-SENIOR-RATE
    PERFORM FIXED-UPLIFT
    DISPLAY "BONUS-RATE=" BONUS-RATE
    STOP RUN.
2500-SENIOR-RATE.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS
    IF TX-CUSTOMER-AGE >= 62
       AND TX-CURR-BAL >= 10000
        COMPUTE BONUS-RATE = TX-BASE-RATE + 0.0025
    ELSE
        MOVE TX-BASE-RATE TO BONUS-RATE
    END-IF.
FIXED-UPLIFT.
    *> FIXED DEPOSIT UPLIFT
    IF ACCT-FIXED
        COMPUTE BONUS-RATE = BONUS-RATE + 0.0015
    END-IF.
